  ],
  "en": [
   "3D model of the end car of the driverless T251 train (Kawasaki / CRRC Qingdao Sifang) on Singapore's MRT Thomson–East Coast Line, sized to sit on a toy chassis. White body, black face, orange-brown and gold stripe. Dimensions were read from photographs."
  ]
